      "widgets_values": [
        "Create from original media. Set Source folder, Display name, Prompt alias and Descriptor. Edit source media shows thumbnails, ranges and ordering.\n\nPicture, Video and Combined video profiles each default to 1024 short edge. Add profiles for choices you want available during generation. Each profile is encoded directly from originals."
      ],
      "color": "#283d49",
      "bgcolor": "#172932"
    },
